  {
    "id": "0200",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "我已將你的名指示他們，還要指示他們，使你所愛我的愛在他們裏面，我也在他們裏面。」",
    "target": [
      43,
      17,
      26
    ],
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 195,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 7.6585,
    "sha256": "424a1e079b7762618fc5b88f6f03569ed749f15dd5cd84631b377b807cee2c8e"
  },
  {
    "id": "0205",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "耶穌說：「狐狸有洞，天空的飛鳥有窩，只是人子沒有枕頭的地方。」",
    "target": [
      42,
      9,
      58
    ],
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 5.9879375,
    "sha256": "ac50e6bee5207129e498a63d97b4b2955b209be9f3546b948a4f18c399308f43"
  },
  {
    "id": "0210",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "並使他的兒子經火，又觀兆，用法術，立交鬼的和行巫術的，多行耶和華眼中看爲惡的事，惹動他的怒氣；",
    "target": [
      12,
      21,
      6
    ],
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 150,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 11.6820625,
    "sha256": "185eba70c75be61592970fd9a7951f4cdde6d961c3758e1e771ac78f2767cd64"
  },
  {
    "id": "0215",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "我們出錢才得水喝； 我們的柴是人賣給我們的。",
    "target": [
      25,
      5,
      4
    ],
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 195,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 3.7561875,
    "sha256": "d6d581a24a30285d7e618d4214660a87ea387e67cac5e7a16cf67d60df025fe3"
  },
  {
    "id": "0220",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "不可露你兒婦的下體；她是你兒子的妻，不可露她的下體。",
    "target": [
      3,
      18,
      15
    ],
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 5.3570625,
    "sha256": "6c5c3d6b34682f9a1957506a739062d4b1ddca8feb8654a1d6d3c1dc8dde7ae8"
  },
  {
    "id": "0225",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "說：「以掃若來擊殺這一隊，剩下的那一隊還可以逃避。」",
    "target": [
      1,
      32,
      8
    ],
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 150,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 5.8491875,
    "sha256": "dd8b36777f59b916bea82159fcf9101aaee55236caefc5cb874cdf2f8006dbf1"
  },
  {
    "id": "0230",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "麥西生路低人、亞拿米人、利哈比人、拿弗土希人、",
    "target": [
      1,
      10,
      13
    ],
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 195,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 5.187875,
    "sha256": "fac345f1232a649e07e1ed0e1b81aadda177d7c74c0c9c782d567fc53608eb7b"
  },
  {
    "id": "0235",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "一月之內，我除滅三個牧人，因爲我的心厭煩他們；他們的心也憎嫌我。",
    "target": [
      38,
      11,
      8
    ],
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 6.277,
    "sha256": "58b1431c312ed2ba3ed562dc447e2781db217ec01002ce70e9f19bbe208318d7"
  },
  {
    "id": "0240",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "七月二十三日，王遣散衆民；他們因見耶和華向大衛和所羅門與他民以色列所施的恩惠，就都心中喜樂，各歸各家去了。",
    "target": [
      14,
      7,
      10
    ],
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 150,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 13.3354375,
    "sha256": "e26bec90520c9bd6aa84b66b1223db41036e4b29b0be4e557317794c6835606d"
  },
  {
    "id": "0245",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "惟恐多說，你嫌煩絮，只求你寬容聽我們說幾句話。",
    "target": [
      44,
      24,
      4
    ],
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 195,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 4.8430625,
    "sha256": "00ef4e9f454443ba713334f6b9e4d9a103b4fd4941c7766ec1fd80094eaf1b45"
  },
  {
    "id": "0250",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "所羅門在耶路撒冷作以色列衆人的王共四十年。",
    "target": [
      11,
      11,
      42
    ],
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 4.77875,
    "sha256": "d74109bdae85bf1ffaa5fc992e79800ef803e43b773470941f7a8a9e75e0905e"
  },
  {
    "id": "0255",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "主－我們的 神是憐憫饒恕人的，我們卻違背了他，",
    "target": [
      27,
      9,
      9
    ],
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 150,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 4.662875,
    "sha256": "b0fc20dbfb23b132ccaa91ac7984e79b15f3729b3ad2f0f570fbbf9fc15bdf3f"
  },
  {
    "id": "0260",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "從那日起，我的僕人一半做工，一半拿槍、拿盾牌、拿弓、穿 鎧甲，官長都站在猶大衆人的後邊。",
    "target": [
      16,
      4,
      16
    ],
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 195,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 9.3191875,
    "sha256": "83b250bbda44fc0b81eb0c1eca1227460bc1c705a3dc4e45a2a1e45c7d17aad6"
  },
  {
    "id": "0265",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "埃及中，無論是頭與尾， 棕枝與蘆葦，所做之工都不成就。",
    "target": [
      23,
      19,
      15
    ],
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 5.4676875,
    "sha256": "35b50527bede503d5e471d0703dcb15a95ed4d8974022841aec304b637ef7d86"
  },
  {
    "id": "0270",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "願憐恤、平安、慈愛多多地加給你們。",
    "target": [
      65,
      1,
      2
    ],
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 150,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 4.3475,
    "sha256": "a33bf219e5380b0db08f50eb101f6f6f7bf81195133ec96b7aaddfe9c41d6f76"
  },
  {
    "id": "0275",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "你們不要自欺；濫交是敗壞善行。",
    "target": [
      46,
      15,
      33
    ],
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 195,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 2.889,
    "sha256": "8cb0ae1b49a7f7f3f048c169debb18155cfd4a5e9026bdd92fbc7aca36dd3795"
  },
  {
    "id": "0280",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "並且因爲他是人子，就賜給他行審判的權柄。",
    "target": [
      43,
      5,
      26
    ],
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 4.649375,
    "sha256": "eef60d763cc19b9b22428a36c5403745a26382eb0756534482552fadf7d682fe"
  },
  {
    "id": "0285",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "那獻供物的就要將細面伊法十分之一，並油一欣四分之一，調和作素祭，獻給耶和華。",
    "target": [
      4,
      15,
      4
    ],
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 150,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": false,
    "duration_s": 8.774375,
    "sha256": "547dbd6a18ccf53b7598322e95b8b32b45fa6b0ffe669274de85ffe7dc0f24dc"
  },
  {
    "id": "0290",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "說假預言的先知，就是預言本心詭詐的先知，他們這樣存心要到幾時呢？ 他們各人將所做的夢對鄰舍述說，想要使我的百姓忘記我的名，正如他們列祖因巴力忘記我的名一樣。",
    "target": [
      24,
      23,
      26
    ],
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 195,
    "split": "calibration",
    "cross_verse": true,
    "duration_s": 15.1954375,
    "sha256": "0f34e7a970e48f75cdbfe2b722548b91e0cd9e80afd278c12da95b23feb762b2"
  },
  {
    "id": "0295",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "我們要爲你編上金辮，鑲上銀釘。 〔新娘〕 王正坐席的時候， 我的哪噠香膏發出香味。",
    "target": [
      22,
      1,
      11
    ],
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "split": "calibration",
